# Built-in lesson. Text fields are bilingual "English|Chinese" (format: src/song/Song.h).
title: Lesson 11: First Chords Em / Am|第11课 和弦入门 Em / Am
artist: Exercise|练习
bpm: 70
time: 4/4
level: 1
desc: The two easiest chords. Em: string 5 fret 2 + string 4 fret 2 (middle and ring fingers), strum all six strings; Am: start the strum from string 5 and don't hit string 6.|最简单的两个和弦. Em: 5弦2品 + 4弦2品 (中指、无名指), 六根弦全扫; Am: 从 5 弦开始扫, 不要扫到 6 弦.
desc: Tip: strum down once per beat (v = down strum). First change chords every two bars, then every bar; move your fingers together as one shape.|小贴士: 每拍向下扫一次 (v = 下扫). 先每两小节换一次和弦, 再每小节换一次; 换和弦时手指整体移动.
---
